Subject: [PATCH 26/45] np2: tell the model backticks have no shell and
 bash("...") does

In the first scored NP2 cell the model put pipes, globs and 2>&1 inside
backtick commands 9 times, each a failed call.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/neurajl.ts | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/neurajl.ts b/packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/neurajl.ts
